10         Completed the Study = count patients where DSREASCD='Completed'.
11         Discontinued = count patients where DSREASCD ne 'Completed'.
12         Display all discontinuation reasons alphabetically by DSREASCD.
13         Percentage = 100 * n in cell / N with ADSL.TRTAN value.
